    "notes": [
      "Static/container validation only. Dealer streaming/replication and server equip confirmation require in-game smoke testing.",
      "No Electric/Sea1 hardcoded movement branch was added. The fix applies to every style using RE4StyleProgress dealer resolution.",
      "If an exact live/template dealer is unavailable on a fresh session, the shared island anchor may still be used only to enter streaming range; interaction remains gated on exact dealer resolution."
    ]
